function ignore value:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("discard", value)

function return value:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("return", value)

to get left - right:
    return @intrinsic("subtract", left, right)

flex section if condition:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("if", condition)

to get number has even parity under inversion:
    if @intrinsic("not equal", number, 0):
        return number - 1 has odd parity under inversion
    return 1

to get number has odd parity under inversion:
    if @intrinsic("not equal", number, 0):
        return number - 1 has even parity under inversion
    return 0

ignore 4 has even parity under inversion
